<title>USA: Data Systems warrant call raises $7.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Data Systems warrant call raises $7.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGTON HILLS, Mich. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Systems Network Corp said Wednesday it raised more than $7.3 million from the redemption of all of its outstanding redeemable common stock purchase warrants.</p>
<p>Prior to the warrant call, there were 1,270,000 outstanding warrants, and 1,256,206 were exercised for the equivalent number of common shares at $6.25 per share.</p>
<p>It said the remaining 13,794 unexercised warrants are being redeemed by the company at a price of $0.05 each.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
